DESCRIPTION:United Nations Association FIlm FestivalThe United Nations Ass
 ociation Film Festival (UNAFF) is pleased to announce the program for its 
 29th edition\, PASSION FOR CHANGE. From Oct. 15–25\, 2026\, in Palo Alto
 \, East Palo Alto\, San Francisco and at Stanford University\, UNAFF will 
 present 60 global documentary films.\nStudents are encouraged to attend th
 e festival and may receive free tickets to films with a valid student ID. 
 For more information\, contact us at info@unaff.org\nSESSIONS\n\nAs docume
 ntaries come in different lengths\, it is impractical to sell tickets for 
 individual films. Instead\, we group multiple films into SESSIONS\, trying
  to combine them loosely by topic so that together they make for a generou
 s viewing experience. So\, if you are interested in a particular film\, fi
 nd its session number and purchase the ticket for that session.\nFESTIVAL 
 PASSES\nThe best deal is to purchase a FESTIVAL PASS\, which allows access
  to all the festival screenings and events during the 11 days of the festi
 val\, and if you are a senior\, you can save even more by taking advantage
  of our deeply discounted SENIOR FESTIVAL PASS.\nADMISSION\nGENERAL ADMISS
 ION – $19 PER FILM SESSION (1.5 – 3 hours per session)\nFESTIVAL PASS 
 – $290\nSENIOR FESTIVAL PASS (62+) – $90\nOPENING NIGHT RECEPTION WITH
  THE FILMMAKERS AND SESSION 1 – $60\nCLOSING NIGHT RECEPTION WITH THE FI
 LMMAKERS AND SESSION 29 – $60\nFREE ADMISSION FOR\nALL STUDENTS WITH VAL
 ID ID\nSESSION 5: UNAFF & KIDS PROGRAM (Oct. 17)\nSESSION 9: SHORT SESSION
  (O...\n\n$19.00\n\nTickets: https://www.unaff.org/2026/contact.html\nDeta
 ils: https://sf.funcheap.com/united-nations-association-film-festival-palo
 -alto-oct-1525/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/UNAFF2
 026_Square_Plain.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261007T060815Z
LOCATION:Mitchell Park Community Center\, 3700 Middlefield Road\, Palo Alt
 o
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/united-nations-association-film-festival-palo-
 alto-oct-1525/
END:VEVENT
