BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Green Film Festival of San Francisco
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T230000
DTSTAMP:20261014T171851Z
UID:funcheap-1640836@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Movies
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerSF IndieFestOct 15-22\, 6pm-11
 pm\nForget the guilt trip\, the Green Film Festival of San Francisco\, the
  mischievous\, tree-hugging cousin of the 29 year old SF IndieFest\, retur
 ns Oct 15-22 to prove that saving the planet doesn’t have to feel like h
 omework. We’ve ditched the doom-and-gloom documentaries that make you wa
 nt to crawl under a (sustainably sourced) blanket and never come out.\n\nT
 he line-up this year pairs sharp environmental storytelling with wit\, wei
 rdness\, and unapologetic irreverence. And yes\, our Eco-Horror midnight m
 ovie is back!\nWhether you’re an eco-curious cinephile or a die-hard act
 ivist\, come join in the fun because if we’re going to talk about the en
 d of the world as we know it\, we might as well laugh\, gasp\, and maybe e
 ven dance a little on the way there.\nThrough this experience the festival
  hopes audiences can begin to engage with sustainable solutions to the pro
 blems facing the planet.\nPresented by SF IndieFest\n\n$15.00\n\nTickets: 
 https://greenfest2026.eventive.org\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/green
 -film-festival-san-francisco-2/\nSource: Funcheap SF\n\nAlso listed on:\n-
  https://www.indybay.org/newsitems/2026/10/03/18888999.php?utm_source=cald
 iscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/4791_v
 0.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261014T171851Z
LOCATION:4-Star Theater\, 2200 Clement St\, San Francisco\, CA 94121
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/green-film-festival-san-francisco-2/
END:VEVENT
