BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Watch “Niu Lai” Indie Film: China’s So-Bad-It’s-Good Anima
 ted Hit
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T170000
DTSTAMP:20261017T204148Z
UID:funcheap-1642706@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Movies
DESCRIPTION:tiatLets watch Niu Lai together <3\n​Niu Lai (Chinese: 牛
 来\; pinyin: Niú Lái\; literally “Here Comes the Cow” or “The Bul
 l is Coming”) is a viral 2026 Chinese animated indie film that became a 
 massive “so bad\, it’s good” box office sleeper hit.\n​​⭑.ᐟ 
 More on Niu Lai\n\n​Niu Lai is an 86-minute abstract adventure following
  a timid newborn calf who grows into a braver ox through a dream-like jour
 ney alongside his mother and other forest animals.\n\n​It was made over 
 a five-year period by a mother-and-son duo\, director Xin Yumeng and write
 r/composer Sun Lifang\, who handled the script\, animation\, voice acting\
 , and soundtrack almost entirely by themselves.\n\n​Created on a tiny bu
 dget (reported around $200 to a few thousand yuan) using basic architectur
 al modeling and design software like SketchUp on secondhand hardware.\n\n
 ​After opening to almost no audience and earning just a few thousand yua
 n in its first week\, clips of its stiff\, glitchy\, and surreal computer-
 generated imagery spread across Chinese social media.\n\n​Online ridicul
 e turned into genuine curiosity and cult-classic status\, driving audience
 s to theaters en masse and pushing its gross past $9 million (making it on
 e of the most profitable films relative to its budget). Audiences often co
 ntrasted its earnest\, human-made charm with slick\, AI-generated content.
 \n\n​​⭑.ᐟ Chinamaxxing\n​A group exhibition on view 9/25 – 10/
 17 at TIAT in SF ⭑.ᐟ\n​Drink hot water. Learn the characters. Buy th
 e robot dog. Imagine the future happening somewhe...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: h
 ttps://luma.com/niulai\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/watch-niu-lai-ind
 ie-film-chinas-sobaditsgood-animated-hit-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gulfne
 ws_2026-08-18_n9up7len_cow.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261017T204148Z
LOCATION:tiat\, 151 Powell St. San Francisco
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/watch-niu-lai-indie-film-chinas-sobaditsgood-a
 nimated-hit-sf/
END:VEVENT
