DESCRIPTION:Looking for a free night out that's weirder than whatever's in
  your queue? The Church of Mother Gong's Psychedelic Film Series continues
  with I Drink Your Blood\, David E. Durston's notorious grindhouse classic
 . A band of Satanic hippies rolls into a small town and doses the wrong gr
 andpa. A kid gets revenge with a batch of very ill-advised meat pies\, and
  things go rabidly\, gloriously off the rails from there. It's strange\, n
 asty\, darkly funny\, and completely unhinged: a delirious time capsule of
  early-'70s counterculture paranoia\, best seen in a room full of people c
 ackling along with you. It runs 90 minutes and costs zero dollars\, which 
 makes it the easiest Halloween-season plan you'll make all month.\n\nFree\
 n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/21/free-movie-night-satani
 c-hippies-lsd-and-rabid-meat-pies-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
