DESCRIPTION:Q: Are we not men?\nA: WE ARE MANOS!\n\nMike (Harold P. Warren
 ) and Maggie (Diane Mahree) are on a road trip with their daughter and fam
 ily dog. But they take a wrong turn and wind up at a lodge inhabited by a 
 polygamous pagan cult! The family finds themselves in the middle of a powe
 r struggle between caretaker Torgo (John Reynolds)\, cult leader The Maste
 r (Tom Neyman)\, and two warring factions of the Master’s wives. The sol
 e directorial effort of Texas fertilizer salesman Warren\, MANOS: THE HAND
 S OF FATE is an absurdist masterpiece. Prepare to exit the planet.\n\nDeta
 ils: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/21/manos-the-hands-of-fate-ticket
 s\nSource: DoTheBay
