DESCRIPTION:Part of Gialloween VI!\n\nAt the peak of his Seventies cinemat
 ic triumphs\, horror legend Dario Argento (Suspiria\, Phenomena\, Tenebrae
 ) created projects for RAI TV that broadcast his singular vision into mill
 ions of Italian homes. “Door Into Darkness” is Argento’s top-rated 1
 973 giallo anthology series produced and hosted by the maestro himself. Ar
 gento also directed two of the series’ four episodes\, which comprise th
 is theatrical program.\n\n“The Tram” is easily the series’ best epis
 ode. A young woman is murdered one night on a busy commuter train without 
 other passengers noticing. The case poses a challenge to Inspector Giordan
 i\, who decides to stage a re-enactment with the passengers. Expanded from
  a sequence originally written for The Bird With the Crystal Plumage\, thi
 s lively mystery boasts a terrific climax and a slew of familiar character
  actors from Argento’s films to that point\n\nRuntime\n\n2h 0m\n\nYear\n
 \n1973\n\nDirector\n\nDario Argento\n\nFormat\n\nDigital\n\nCountry\n\nIta
 ly\n\nLanguage\n\nItalian with English subtitles\n\nFirst Showing\n\nOctob
 er 21\, 2026\n\nCategories\n\nGialloween VI\n\n\,\n\nFeatured\n\nDetails: 
 https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/21/dario-argento-s-door-into-darkness-
 tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
