 , a young girl\, and an immortal cat to put an end to their reign of terro
 r once and for all.\n\nAbout Floating Features\n\nSan Francisco Legacy Bus
 inesses Red and White Fleet and The Roxie are partnering to turn the hybri
 d electric vessel Enhydra into a sailing cinema for a limited run of night
 time film cruises on the Bay. Join us this autumn for a 2-hour twilight cr
 uise and a feature film handpicked by the Roxie. Our electric vessel means
  no engine noise and a totally unique al fresco movie experience.\n\nFull 
 schedule available here.\n\nRuntime\n\n1h 36m\n\nYear\n\n1993\n\nDirector\
 n\nKenny Ortega\n\nFormat\n\nDCP\n\nCountry\n\nUSA\n\nLanguage\n\nEnglish\
