DESCRIPTION:SPARK SF\, Warner Bros.\n\nFree outdoor screening of Blue Beet
 le at SPARK Social SF\, in partnership with Cine+Mas San Francisco Latino 
 Film Festival!\n\nCine+Más: Blue Beetle Movie Night – A Celebration of 
 Latino Cinema and Community!\nJoin us for a special outdoor movie night pr
 esented by SPARK Social SF and Cine+Más San Francisco Latino Film Festiva
 l! We’re bringing Latino cinema\, community\, and a little movie magic u
 nder the stars at SPARK Social SF.\nGrab your friends and family\, enjoy s
 ome delicious food and drinks from the park\, and settle in for a FREE scr
 eening of Blue Beetle on the SPARK Social SF Field.\n🪲 Feature Film: Bl
 ue Beetle\nSaturday\, October 24 | 6:30 PM\nSPARK Social SF | 601 Mission 
 Bay Blvd North\, San Francisco\, CA 94158\nFree Admission | Open to all!\n
 Arrive early to grab a spot on the field\, lay out your blanket\, and get 
 ready for an evening of movies\, food\, community\, and fun under the San 
 Francisco sky.\nFood Trucks\nEnjoy delicious bites from 15+ food trucks se
 rving up a variety of meals and snacks throughout the evening. Grab dinner
 \, drinks\, and something to enjoy during the film!\nAbout Cine+Más SF\nC
 ine+Más San Francisco Latino Film Festival contributes to the Bay Area’
 s vibrant and diverse arts scene through its annual Latino Film Festival a
 nd year-round programming celebrating Latino arts and culture.\nThe festiv
 al showcases films by emerging and established filmmakers from the US\, La
 tin America\, Spain\, and Portugal\, highlighting creative works from arou
 nd the...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/cinemas-blue-be
 etle-tickets-2003175027431?\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/blue-beetle-
