 venge\, Seatopia unleashes Megalon\, a gigantic beetle with the ability to
  fire ray beams and napalm bombs. Meanwhile\, Rokuro’s brother creates J
 et Jaguar\, a flying robot with a built-in moral compass. The inevitable m
 atchup of Godzilla and Jet Jaguar versus Megalon and Gigan decides the wor
 ld’s fate. (Janus)\n\nTickets: https://drafthouse.com/sf/show/godzilla-v
 s-megalon?cinemaId=0802&sessionId=21623\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/eve
