DESCRIPTION:Lady is an off-beat comedy about a lonely\, narcissistic arist
 ocrat who dupes a struggling\, opportunistic director into filming her eve
 ry move. But her obsession with the spotlight takes a surreal turn when sh
 e starts becoming… invisible. Blending mockumentary and magical realism\
 , Lady satirises our desperate need to feel seen.\n\n“Outrageous mockume
 ntary is like Saltburn on shrooms” – The Guardian\n\nMore showtimes to
  be added\n\nRuntime\n\n1h 37m\n\nYear\n\n2025\n\nDirector\n\nSamuel Abrah
