 r. When a group of migrants crossing the U.S.-Mexico border is hunted thro
 ugh the desert by an armed vigilante\, the journey becomes a brutal fight 
 for survival. Starring Gael García Bernal and Jeffrey Dean Morgan.\n\nAud
 ience members can also add a $5 or $10 donation to La Raza Centro Legal wh
 en purchasing tickets\, supporting their work with immigrant communities i
 n the Bay Area.\n\nRuntime\n\n1h 34m\n\nYear\n\n2015\n\nDirector\n\nJonás
