BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:New People: The Great Experiment
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T200000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17866473@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:This screening will take place at NEW PEOPLE CINEMA\, located 
 at 1746 Post Street in Japantown.\n\nFollowed by a post-screening Q&A with
  Co-Director Eric Daniel Metzgar\n\nTHE GREAT EXPERIMENT is an epic poem i
 n documentary form—a mirror held to an American nation at war with its o
 wn reflection\, asking not who is right\, but whether the experiment itsel
 f can survive.\n\nFilmed in striking black and white across the US over fo
 ur consequential years\, from 2017 to 2021\, the film considers the result
 s of what George Washington once called “our last great experiment” in
  democracy.\n\nThe approach is spatial and observational—less interested
  in the ideological binary of left and right than in the vast\, complicate
 d country that exists at the intersection of many kinds of American experi
 ence.\n\nMuch as Robert Frank traveled the U.S. in the mid-1950s—bearing
  witness yet refusing to editorialize in his seminal photographic antholog
 y of America—the film weaves these lives together not to resolve their c
 ontradictions\, but to hold them in the same frame long enough for somethi
 ng surprising to emerge.\n\nRuntime\n\n1h 40m\n\nYear\n\n2026\n\nDirector\
 n\nStephen Maing & Eric Daniel Metzgar\n\nFormat\n\nDCP\n\nFirst Showing\n
 \nOctober 29\, 2026\n\nCategories\n\nNew People Cinema\n\n\,\n\nFeatured\n
 \nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/22144?siteToken=b6y
 5tsmq2ayrxb4ymw2rah8wy0\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/29/n
 ew-people-the-great-experiment-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7647103;-122.4224081
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34538606/2d4f938f-386e-467e-ad77-4d92bb13cb98.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:Roxie Theater\, 3117 16th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/29/new-people-the-great-experiment
 -tickets
END:VEVENT
