DESCRIPTION:Did you know that "Rock's chosen warriors will rule the apocal
 ypse"? Skippy from Family Ties worships heavy metal warlord Sammi Curr\, a
 ka the master of "Rock Pornography." Skippy and his best friend Roger are 
 bullied at school by a legion of buff dudes and an asshole named Tim. Then
  Sammi dies and Tim humiliates Skippy in front of the girl of his dreams. 
 Skippy says\, "I'm gonna NAIL those guys!" An LP plays backwards and Sammi
 ’s satanic spirit takes to the town’s electrical outlets. Let the nail
 ing begin! A girl gets her ears (and libido) fried during a demonized Walk
 man attack. Sammi slings lightning bolts from his guitar at the Halloween 
 dance. And of course\, a possessed stereo acts as an instrument of destruc
 tion! TRICK OR TREAT plays out like a warm-up for Freaks and Geeks\, if th
 at show was scored with wall-to-wall metal obscurities instead of Rush and
  the theme from CADDYSHACK. Plus scumbag roles from two scumbags named Ozz
 y Osbourne and Gene Simmons. P.S. This movie is as good as it sounds. (Jos
 eph A. Ziemba)\n\nTickets: https://drafthouse.com/sf/show/trick-or-treat-1
 986?cinemaId=0802&sessionId=21347\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/20
 26/10/30/trick-or-treat-1986-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
