SUMMARY:Club Kid\, in 35mm
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261102T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261102T193000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17873792@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment and SFFILM present\nClub Kid (in 
 35mm)\nMonday\, November 2 | The Castro\n\nClub Kid plunges audiences head
 first into the exhilarating\, sybaritic universe of New York City nightlif
 e. First-time writer-director Jordan Firstman stars as Peter\, a magnetic 
 club promoter whose lifestyle of revelry is upended when he unexpectedly d
 iscovers he fathered a young boy. Thrust into parenthood\, Peter navigates
  his newfound responsibilities in fits and starts\, relying heavily on his
  chosen family as he works to establish a philosophy for intimate love. Fi
 rstman’s script and performance deftly balance outrageous humor and anar
 chic energy with an unexpected emotional generosity. Newcomer Reggie Absol
 om is terrific as Peter’s son\, Arlo\, holding his own alongside a wonde
 rfully unpredictable ensemble featuring Cara Delevingne\, Diego Calva\, Ki
 rby Howell-Baptiste\, Miss Benny\, and Colleen Camp. Presented in 35mm\, t
 he film possesses a tactile physicality and vivid sense of place\, while k
 iller needle drops perfectly compliment the multitudes of Peter and Arlo
 ’s experiences. Poignant and irreverent\, Club Kid offers an insider’s
  glimpse into a distinctive culture while resonating with anyone who has s
 truggled to find their place in the world. Funny\, heartfelt\, and singula
 r\, Club Kid is an irresistible invitation to experience something you won
 ’t soon forget. —Jessie Fairbanks\n\nRated R\nAnother Planet Entertain
 ment and SFFILM present\nListed time is doors\n\nTickets: https://thecastr
 o.com/events/club-kid-261102\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11
 /2/club-kid-in-35mm-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7619917;-122.4347365
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34573889/504691c9-493f-4564-b351-eebd57439bc2.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:The Castro\, 429 Castro St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94114
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/2/club-kid-in-35mm-tickets
END:VEVENT
