DESCRIPTION:Robert Longo’s JOHNNY MNEMONIC: IN BLACK & WHITE strips the 
 cyberpunk thriller down to its starkest elements\, turning its corporate d
 ystopia\, overloaded data networks\, and street-level futurism into someth
 ing even more graphic and uncanny. Keanu Reeves stars as a data courier ca
 rrying information directly in his brain\, racing to deliver a dangerous p
 ayload before it kills him. Syd Mead contributed concept designs to the fi
 lm\, bringing his industrial\, lived-in vision of the future to a world of
  megacorporations\, obsolete technology\, and information overload.\n\nPar
 t of The Future According to Syd Mead\, presented in conjunction with Syd 
 Mead: Future Pastime\, on view October 8 through December 17\, 2026 at San
  Francisco’s Transamerica Pyramid Annex Gallery.\n\nRuntime\n\n1h 36m\n\
 nYear\n\n1995\n\nDirector\n\nRobert Longo\n\nFormat\n\nDCP\n\nFirst Showin
 g\n\nNovember 27\, 2026\n\nCategories\n\nThe Future According to Syd Mead\
 n\n\,\n\nFeatured\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/
 22259?siteToken=4m48btf3yavn7xjk5yxk6nc40c\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/
 events/2026/11/27/johnny-mnemonic-in-black-and-white-tickets\nSource: DoTh
