SUMMARY:Small Town Gay Bar
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261201T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261201T203000
DTSTAMP:20261017T204148Z
UID:dothebay-17963791@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment Presents\n20th Anniversary\nSmall
  Town Gay Bar\nHosted by Peaches Christ w/ special guest Director Malcolm 
 Ingram\nTuesday\, December 1 | The Castro\n\nTwo decades ago\, director Ma
 lcolm Ingram shined a beautiful\, raw\, and deeply moving spotlight on the
  resilience of LGBTQ+ communities in the Deep South with his groundbreakin
 g documentary\, Small Town Gay Bar. This year\, we are bringing it back to
  San Francisco’s most iconic silver screen.\n\nSmall Town Gay Bar is a t
 ribute to the resiliency of gays living in rural areas throughout America.
  A moving portrait of men and women fighting to create and maintain commun
 ity for themselves in the face of great opposition\, hypocrisy and prejudi
 ce in a largely ignored subculture of discreet backdoor entrances and hush
 ed sexual expression in small town Mississippi.\n\nExperience the film lik
 e never before with a gorgeous\, brand-new 4K restoration print that captu
 res every ounce of heart\, struggle\, and triumph in crystal-clear definit
 ion. Following the screening\, Peaches will sit down with special guest di
 rector Malcolm Ingram for an exclusive\, live Q&A diving deep into the leg
 acy of the film\, behind-the-scenes secrets\, and how the landscape of que
 er safe spaces has evolved over the last twenty years.\n\nDon’t miss thi
 s rare opportunity to celebrate queer history\, cinema\, and community at 
 the Castro Theatre!\n\nall ages\nAnother Planet Entertainment Presents: 20
 th Anniversary\nListed time is doors\n\nTickets: https://thecastro.com/eve
 nts/small-town-gay-bar\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/1/sma
 ll-town-gay-bar-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7619917;-122.4347365
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34996220/dbf23b43-8387-42ed-af04-79ff8bd39f93.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261017T204148Z
LOCATION:The Castro\, 429 Castro St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94114
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/1/small-town-gay-bar-tickets
END:VEVENT
