CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment presents\nCircle Jerks x Repo Man
 \n\nSunday\, December 6 | The Castro\n\nCircle Jerks formed in Los Angeles
  in 1979 and quickly became one of the key bands of the early Southern Cal
 ifornia punk scene. Their debut album\, Group Sex\, came out in 1980 and r
 emains one of the essential records of the era. More than 40 years later\,
  Circle Jerks are still doing what they’ve always done—playing loud\, 
 fast and unapologetic punk rock.\n\nThat same Los Angeles punk scene is at
  the heart of Alex Cox’s 1984 film Repo Man. The movie follows Otto\, a 
 young punk who gets pulled into the bizarre world of car repossession whil
 e capturing a very specific version of early ’80s Los Angeles.\n\nThe ni
 ght will start with a Circle Jerks set\, followed by a Q&A with director A
 lex Cox\, Keith Morris\, and Zander Schloss (Kevin the Nerd and Circle Jer
 ks bassist)\, then a screening of the cult classic Repo Man.\n\nAll Ages\n
 Sold out\nAnother Planet Entertainment presents\nListed time is doors\n\nT
 ickets: https://thecastro.com/events/circle-jerks-x-repo-man-261206\nDetai
 ls: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/6/circle-jerks-x-repo-man-tickets\
 nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7619917;-122.4347365
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34573890/2650a6ef-7865-448c-b401-ddb0142f4e91.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261009T182357Z
LOCATION:The Castro\, 429 Castro St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94114
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/6/circle-jerks-x-repo-man-tickets
END:VEVENT
